    "updated_at": "2023-08-27T23:30:53Z",
    "body": "I don’t have any way to take an object of properties and turn them into a URL, except `Object.assign(new URL(foo), properties)` - and there’s not a good blank URL to use that’s also special, so that properties can be any URL. Why arbitrarily prevent transitions if it’s mutable at all?",
