    "updated_at": "2023-09-04T01:31:21Z",
    "body": "I received a question on https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1416018 and posted a reply on https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1416018#c11.\r\n\r\nI just assumed that the standard intentionally included this limitation. ",
